{"v":4,"catch":"<發件人: david_30@nogravitygames.com> 主題: 奇怪的CD","desc":"你好，\n\n希望你近況還好。我收到了你寄來的CD。在大致看了一下文檔後，我覺得還是有希望恢復軟體的。儘管數據有所損毀，但軟體應該還能運行。\n\n我還沒深入研究，但這看上去像一款簡單的遊戲。不少文檔標了「地圖」，還有一些槍支，看上去像一款復古射擊遊戲。\n\n我要去睡一覺。昨晚沒睡好，做了很多噩夢，但內容記不清了。會盡快會向你匯報最新進展。\n\n祝好，\n戴維","publisher":"No Gravity Games","release":"2021-05-13","genres":["射擊","動作","冒險","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/28c6ff390ccf72cf6a80c57c108eb3ec050275f214ad59a90c750613bead97eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d05b8f6f9db40a6a3cebb15f106e3d46d1de0b63486b2e12b759888517d29452.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cc94b532cb867a29e52144a3d97ffd0d00400ac00fbc18ac1c770aee938c0cf0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cfcae258a74a0f11f77d339416250c121cea07c1a92c1ff340c852962168315.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ffe5537ffc7cb83bdb297155812df7c339bb7a791c153ca67d111554d21c7649.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c852c4e47403dc8dc79a3c8a920c7162a33037209e579315deb55fec2ea0041.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e84014c72000","dlc":[]}